  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>A reminder that my new cookbook is now <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet-cookbook/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">available for preorder</a>! We will be rolling out teaser recipes on our social media, so be sure to follow us on <a href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\">Instagram</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org\">Facebook</a> if you don’t already. </p>\n<p>I’ve continued doing a lot of interviews on a range of topics, especially pandemics based on my latest book, <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-to-survive-a-pandemic/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to Survive a Pandemic</a>. I recently contributed to an article in <a href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/debate/article-8490351/More-giant-factory-farms-inevitably-mean-create-deadly-pandemics.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/debate/article-8490351/More-giant-factory-farms-inevitably-mean-create-deadly-pandemics.html\">The Daily Mail</a>. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Now Hiring Two Full-Time, Remote Positions</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-57835 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG.png 649w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/02/Were-Hiring-IG-540x539.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Design Director: Responsible for organizing and executing design projects, prioritizing creative requests, and helping the organization reach its strategic goals through creative thinking, artistic ability, and problem-solving. This position also oversees and coordinates the production of our video content.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/employment/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Social Media Administrative Assistant</strong></a>: Responsible for organizing and scheduling social media content, <a href=\"https://graphically.io\">creating templated graphics</a>, and assisting the Director of Nutrition and Social Media Strategy with oversight of our accounts. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Doctor and Dietitian Q&amp;A</h4>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-65604 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Doctor &amp; Dietitian – Q&amp;A – IG 9-18-20\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Doctor-Dietitian-–-QA-–-IG-9-18-20.png 1091w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Join me for another live Instagram Q&amp;A, this time with my good friend and distinguished colleague, <a href=\"https://www.brendadavisrd.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.brendadavisrd.com/\">Brenda Davis</a>,<a href=\"https://www.brendadavisrd.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.brendadavisrd.com/\"> R.D</a>. <p></p>\n<p>Head over to the <a href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://instagram.com/nutrition_facts_org/\">NutritionFacts.org Instagram</a> page on <em><strong>October 22 at 9pm ET </strong></em>to get the answers to all of your health and nutrition questions.</p></div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">New Book by Eric Adams</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65606 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM-1024x860.png\" alt=\"Healthy at Last Eric Adams\" width=\"202\" height=\"170\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM-1024x860.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM-960x806.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM-768x645.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM-1200x1008.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM-720x605.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM-540x453.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/Screen-Shot-2020-10-07-at-3.22.26-PM.png 1372w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 202px) 100vw, 202px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In his new book <em data-stringify-type=\"italic\">Healthy at Last</em><em data-stringify-type=\"italic\">,</em><em data-stringify-type=\"italic\"> </em>Brooklyn borough president Eric Adams shares his incredible story of reversing type-2 diabetes by adopting a plant-based diet. Order it <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Healthy-Last-Plant-Based-Preventing-Reversing/dp/1401960561\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Healthy-Last-Plant-Based-Preventing-Reversing/dp/1401960561\">on Amazon</a> or wherever you get your books.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Help Transform the Dietary Guidelines Worldwide</h4>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-65608 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"proveg\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/proveg-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>National dietary guidelines serve as a framework for millions of meals around the globe, from school lunches to doctors’ recommendations, but many are manipulated by corporate actors to undermine the science. Because so many lives are on the line, we’re teaming up with ProVeg International to organize a powerful team of scientists, doctors, and advocates to make guidelines globally more evidence-based.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"472\" height=\"153\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 472px) 100vw, 472px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65013 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The World&#39;s Largest Fasting Study\" width=\"260\" height=\"146\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-06-The-Worlds-Largest-Fasting-Study.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 260px) 100vw, 260px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-worlds-largest-fasting-study/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The World’s Largest Fasting Study</a><p></p>\n<p>Buchinger modified fasting is put to the test.</p></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65238 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"261\" height=\"147\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-04-The-Best-Diet-for-Weight-Loss-and-Disease-Prevention-1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 261px) 100vw, 261px\"/></a></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-best-diet-for-weight-loss-and-disease-prevention/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Best Diet for Weight Loss and Disease Prevention</a><p></p>\n<p>The most effective diet for weight loss may also be the most healthful.</p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-65236 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"260\" height=\"146\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/09/51-05-The-Benefits-of-Fasting-for-Healing-1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 260px) 100vw, 260px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-benefits-of-fasting-for-healing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Benefits of Fasting for Healing</a></p>\n<p>Where did the idea of therapeutic fasting come from?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/vol-spot.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-65612 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/vol-spot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"176\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/vol-spot.png 702w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/vol-spot-540x202.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 470px) 100vw, 470px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2.jpeg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-65614 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2-1024x1364.jpeg\" alt=\"tania bassi\" width=\"199\" height=\"265\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2-1024x1364.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2-960x1279.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2-768x1023.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2-1200x1598.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2-720x959.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2020/10/NF_t-shirt_2-540x719.jpeg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 199px) 100vw, 199px\"/></a></p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Tania Bassi</h4>\n<p>\nI love being a NutritionFacts volunteer. I started about three years ago as a Portuguese translator and, from the beginning, was delighted to imagine that I was collaborating with such a noble initiative to bring vital health information to people around the world. It inspires me to know that I can help to make reliable information, purely based on science, available and accessible to as many people as possible worldwide.</p>\n<p><em>My favorite recipe</em>: Mash two bananas with some ginger, cinnamon, and clove powder, and top with blueberries, chopped strawberries, and nuts.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Live Q&amp;A on October 22</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Every month, I do a live Q&amp;A right from my treadmill, and <em><strong>October 22</strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<p>Join on our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook</a> page OR <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\">YouTube</a> channel at 3pm ET. I’ll be streaming to both at the same time!</p>\n<p>You can find links to all of my past live Q&amp;As <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, I also have an <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">audio podcast</a> to keep you company.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
